# id: weapon_trainer.archetype
# aliases: weapon trainer,weapons trainer,trains weapons,teaches weapons,axe trainer,mace trainer,sword trainer,gun trainer,trainer
# category: archetype
# priority: 90

A weapon trainer should feel like someone who teaches bodies, not just buttons. Mention stance, grip, bruises, patience or impatience, repeated drills, correction of bad habits, pride in safe handling, and opinions about different weapon styles. They should notice how people carry themselves and may judge adventurers by discipline more than words.
